  <!-- base_footprint is the TF root (on the ground): the Gazebo diff_drive
       plugin publishes odom -> base_footprint, so base_footprint must be the
       parent of base_link. If this joint is inverted (base_link -> footprint),
       base_footprint ends up with two parents (odom + base_link) and the TF
       tree breaks -> slam_toolbox drops every scan ("queue is full"). -->
